:: Start
You wake up in a cold room. A door leads north.
(set: $seen to true)
(set: $coins to 7)
[[Open the door->Hall]]
[[Look at the mirror->Mirror]]

:: Hall
A long corridor stretches ahead.
[[Continue->End]]
[[Go back->Start]]

:: Mirror
Your reflection is pale.
(set: $coins to it + 5)
[[Leave->Start]]

:: End
You escape. The end.
